}}
{{Splreflectnotes
| name = Fortune's End
| desc = Does not proc [[Spell Reflection]] sources on secondary affected targets.
}}

 * [[File:Dota2 Cast Range to AoE Visualization icon-1.png|84px]]
** Can affect enemy units at max {{Symbol|bonus cas}} {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:{{#var:Fortune's End cast range}}+{{#var:Fortune's End value1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t2r}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:{{#var:Fortune's End cast range}}+{{#var:Fortune's End value1 tal}}}}|15tal}})-distance away with the [[cast range]] and [[effect radius]].
** Neither can target nor affect the following units:
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}} {{Symbol|fx|s}}
** Plays an ability visual and sound effect on the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit upon cast, visible and audible to everyone.

* The ability has three main components:
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-1.png|1|21px]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}}
*** Applies the following ability effects on the unit-targeted allied unit upon {{M|projectile}} impact.
**** The {{M|basic dispel}}.
*** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
**** {{M|Doubletap}} casts the ability on Oracle.
*** Affects the following allied units:
**** {{M|Courier}}
**** {{M|Hidden}} units.
**** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-2.png|2|21px]] {{Symbol|Projectile|Impact}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}} {{Symbol|Target|Area-Dummy}}
*** The ability effects are applied to all enemy units within radius [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] upon {{M|projectile}} impact as follows:
***# The offensive {{M|basic dispel}}.
***# {{Symbol|Root}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|oracle_fortunes_end_purge}}
***#* Grants {{M|True Sight}} over affected enemy units.
***#* Applies the [[root]] duration correspondingly to the current {{M|channeling}} time, and is defined as:
***#** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|Root {{=}} MINDuration + (MAX - MIN)Duration / (Max[[Channel]]Time × {{#var:Fortune's End basic1}})}}
***#** {{Symbol|a|Up}}
***#*** Increases the total root duration by {{#expr:({{#var:Fortune's End value4}}-{{#var:Fortune's End value3}})/{{#var:Fortune's End value2}}*{{#var:Fortune's End basic1}}}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{#expr:({{#var:Fortune's End value4 tal}}-{{#var:Fortune's End value3 tal}})/{{#var:Fortune's End value2}}*{{#var:Fortune's End basic1}}}}|10tal}}) per {{#var:Fortune's End basic1}}-second channel time.
***#* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
***#** When interrupted, Fortune's End prematurely releases the projectile at the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit's current location.
***#* Does not affect the following enemy units:
***#** {{M|Couriers}}
***#** {{M|Hidden}} units.
***#** {{M|Invulnerable}} units.
***# The {{M|magical}} {{M|spell damage}} within the radius.
** [[File:Dota2 Condition-3.png|3|21px]]
*** {{cf|talnotes}} Applies {{Symbol|bonus t4r}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{Code|oracle_fortunes_end_purge_repeatedly}} to the {{Symbol|Target|Unit}} targeted unit upon projectile impact.
**** The debuff now repetitively applies an offensive {{M|basic dispel}} in {{ValueColor||{{#var:Fortune's End basic1}}|25tal}}-second intervals corresponding to the {{M|channeling}} duration, regardless of the targeted unit's {{M|faction}}.
**** The buff duration is defined as:
***** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|BuffDuration {{=}} MINDuration + (MAX - MIN)Duration / (Max[[Channel]]Time × {{#var:Fortune's End basic1}})}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Fortune's End icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Gathers Oracle's power into a bolt of scouring energy that, when released, damages, roots, and dispels enemies of buffs in an area around the target. If target is an ally it will only dispel debuffs. The root duration increases with channeling time.
}}
* {{Symbol|Projectile|Base}}
** Has {{#var:Fortune's End basic2}}-{{M|projectile speed}}.

